as, say, a website.  I've owned roguelikes.com for a while now, but as
you can see, I'm not doing much with it.  It would make sense to use
it as the URL of a grand roguelikes unifier, a one-stop place to go to
get information on everything in the universe of roguelikes.

So my question is, what exactly should I do with the site?  Would it
